		home_zonestart
			a column created in a subset df called face_index (i.e. for face-off index it seems) which is then merged with the data (only that column)

			a face off index column is created which denotes sequences of corsi events that follow each face. For all rows in a sequence, home_zonestart is given the value 1 if that sequence started with a face off in the home team's defensive zone, 2 if it started and the neutral zone, and 3 if the sequence started in the home team's offensive zone.

