	fun.pbp_prep()
		Order of events and the priority col
			. I noticed that the order of the events did not seem accurate, I fixed the order by clobbering the priority column
			. see the section called 'priority and sortOrder' in these notes for more info and to note any further adjustment that may be required

		Penalty shots -- # Tag events related to a penalty shot
			. in the R scrapped data, penalty shots are identified based on the string in event_description (which states 'penalty shot')
			. in the Python/json data, we don't have that col but the penalties that give rise to a penalty shot all have '*on-breakaway' in their reason (could be secondaryReason).
				- the penalty, the shift changes, the shot or goal, the ensuing faceoff -- all happen at the very same game_second, makes sense the clock doesn't run during a penalty shot
				- the faceoff at that game_second is actually the faceoff from the play resuming after the pen shot and so should not be considered related to the penshot -- just like a regular face off after a penalty call

		There were a few weird conditions, I checked them and decided to omit them
			# View() events where the following condition is met:
			#   !(coords_x == 0 & coords_y == 0 & event_type %in% st.corsi_events &
			#   (pbp_distance != 90 & event_type %in% st.fenwick_events))

			browser()
			boole_1 <- dt$coords_x == 0 & dt$coords_y == 0 & dt$event_type %in% st.corsi_events
			boole_2 <- dt$event_distance != 90 & dt$event_type %in% st.fenwick_events
			# boole_1_2 <- pbp_distance != 90 & event_type %in% st.fenwick_events
			# we don't have pbp_distance (which are always integers)
			dt$boole <- boole_1 & boole_2
			my_cols <- c('game_id', 'period', 'game_seconds', 'event_type', 'event_distance')
			glimpse( dt[ dt$boole, ..my_cols ] )
			# ... i.e. are there any? If not we don't need that condition
			# ... doesn't match anywhere

			# View some of the cols created:
			my_cols = c('game_id', 'period', 'game_seconds', 'event_index', 'event_type', 'seconds_since_last', 'event_type_last', 'event_team_last', 'event_strength_last', 'coords_x_last', 'details.reason', 'sortOrder', 'order_previous')
			View( dt[ , ..my_cols ] )

