	2021-2022 season:
		- I discovered in the spring of 2025 that the coord_* cols have NA for all team with dots in their abbrev. It's not just in the aggregated data, it's in the Src csv files for each game as well, so this is an issue. Solution: I am re-parsing the entire 2021 season my Python scraper.

	event_team
		event_team is created in EH_scrape_functions's sc.events_HTM() as
			mutate(
			  event_team = ifelse(event_type %in% c(sc.main_events, "CHL", "DELPEN"), str_extract(event_description, "^[A-Z]\\.[A-Z]|^[A-Z]+"), NA),
			  event_team = ifelse(!event_team %in% Team_ID_vec, NA, event_team),  ## ensure event_team extacted is an actual team
			  )

		with
			sc.main_events <- c("GOAL", "SHOT", "MISS", "BLOCK", "HIT", "GIVE", "TAKE", "FAC", "PENL")
		and
			Team_ID_vec <- c(
			  "ANA", "ARI", "BOS", "BUF", "CAR", "CBJ", "CGY", "CHI", "COL", "DAL", "DET", "EDM", "FLA", "L.A", "MIN",
			  "MTL", "N.J", "NSH", "NYI", "NYR", "OTT", "PHI", "PIT", "S.J", "STL", "T.B", "TOR", "VAN", "WPG", "WSH",
			  "PHX", "ATL", "VGK", "L.V", "SEA"
			  )

